{"RukuNumber":201,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":12,"SurahIndex":"012","VerseNumber":69,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَمَّا دَخَلُواْ عَلَىٰ يُوسُفَ ءَاوَىٰٓ إِلَيۡهِ أَخَاهُۖ قَالَ إِنِّيٓ أَنَا۠ أَخُوكَ فَلَا تَبۡتَئِسۡ بِمَا كَانُواْ يَعۡمَلُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا دَخَلُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> عَلَىٰ يُوسُفَ ءَاوَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> إِلَيْهِ أَخَاهُ‌ۖ قَالَ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أَنَا۟ أَخُوكَ فَلَا تَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>تَئِسْ بِمَا كَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> يَعْمَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٦٩</span>","End":"٦٩","PageNumber":243,"JuzNumber":13,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":201,"MaqraNumber":97,"HizbNumber":25,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":12,"SurahIndex":"012","VerseNumber":70,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَلَمَّا جَهَّزَهُم بِجَهَازِهِمۡ جَعَلَ ٱلسِّقَايَةَ فِي رَحۡلِ أَخِيهِ ثُمَّ أَذَّنَ مُؤَذِّنٌ أَيَّتُهَا ٱلۡعِيرُ إِنَّكُمۡ لَسَٰرِقُونَ","TajweedText":"فَلَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا جَهَّزَه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>ِجَهَازِهِمْ جَعَلَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سِّقَايَةَ فِى رَحْلِ أَخِيهِ ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ أَذَّنَ مُؤَذِّنٌ أَيَّتُهَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعِيرُ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكُمْ لَسَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٠</span>","End":"٧٠","PageNumber":244,"JuzNumber":13,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":201,"MaqraNumber":97,"HizbNumber":25,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":12,"SurahIndex":"012","VerseNumber":71,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ وَأَقۡبَلُواْ عَلَيۡهِم مَّاذَا تَفۡقِدُونَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> وَأَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>بَلُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> عَلَيْه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ِم م</tajweed>َّاذَا تَفْقِد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧١</span>","End":"٧١","PageNumber":244,"JuzNumber":13,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":201,"MaqraNumber":97,"HizbNumber":25,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":12,"SurahIndex":"012","VerseNumber":72,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ نَفۡقِدُ صُوَاعَ ٱلۡمَلِكِ وَلِمَن جَآءَ بِهِۦ حِمۡلُ بَعِيرٖ وَأَنَا۠ بِهِۦ زَعِيمٞ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> نَفْقِدُ صُوَاعَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَلِكِ وَلِمَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ج</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ بِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> حِمْلُ بَعِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٍ و</tajweed>َأَنَا۟ بِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> زَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٧٢</span>","End":"٧٢","PageNumber":244,"JuzNumber":13,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":201,"MaqraNumber":97,"HizbNumber":25,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":12,"SurahIndex":"012","VerseNumber":73,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالُواْ تَٱللَّهِ لَقَدۡ عَلِمۡتُم مَّا جِئۡنَا لِنُفۡسِدَ فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ وَمَا كُنَّا سَٰرِقِينَ","TajweedText":"قَالُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> تَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ لَقَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed> عَلِمْت<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>َّا جِئْنَا لِنُفْسِدَ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ وَمَا كُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا سَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رِق<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٣</span>","End":"٧٣","PageNumber":244,"JuzNumber":13,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":201,"MaqraNumber":97,"HizbNumber":25,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":12,"SurahIndex":"012","VerseNumber":74,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowB